# Seeds for Next Year
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
I ordered seeds that will not flower until next year.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
That sounds optimistic.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
It sounds like a decision.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
Where will you put them?
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
At the village greenhouse. I asked about helping there.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
The future arrives as a paper packet on the table.
